        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "202. An employee eligible for 12 months' industrial leave of absence who has been terminated due to his/her inability to return to work shall retain seniority as of that date for a period of an additional one (1) year. Such seniority may be utilized during the one (1) year period only for the purpose of bidding on vacancies for which he/she is qualified.",
